OL,5,G0600 Afrodeutsche
OL,6,     FAfrodeutsche brings the best music
OL,7,     Fto your Sunday, and spins some
OL,8,     Fspecial records from her
OL,9,     Fcollection.
OL,10,G0800 Radcliffe and Maconie
OL,11,     FMark and Stuart present a feast of
OL,12,     Fgreat music and chat for weekend
OL,13,     Fbreakfast, plus they celebrate the
OL,14,     F50th anniversary of The Modern
OL,15,     FLovers' debut album.
OL,16,G1000 Cerys Matthews
OL,17,     FCerys hosts your Sunday sonic and
OL,18,     Fcultural adventure. She talks WWII
OL,19,     Fcode breaking with the team from
OL,20,     FBletchley Park, and unearthing
OL,21,     FAfrican recordings with musician
OL,22,     FDele Sosimi.
